00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:02.070
And in this case, the convention of the show is that this is a documentary.

118
00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:02.830
Right.

119
00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.770
This is the world you're going to see every day.

120
