00:47:27.380 --> 00:47:36.400
When Michael wants to prank Pam in front of Ryan the Temp, Michael, as Steve, turns to Ryan, BJ, and says, have you ever seen, you know, do you like prank shows?

1171
00:47:36.620 --> 00:47:37.600
Have you ever seen Punk'd?

1172
00:47:38.500 --> 00:47:39.740
BJ was on Punk'd.

1173
00:47:39.740 --> 00:47:40.460
He was on Punk'd.

1174
00:47:40.460 --> 00:47:41.840
He was on season two of Punk'd.

1175
00:47:41.880 --> 00:47:47.720
So I thought that was a nice little nod that he's looking at someone who was on Punk'd and says, do you like Punk'd?

1176
00:47:47.720 --> 00:47:49.980
And BJ's like, yeah, like as Ryan.

1177
00:47:50.440 --> 00:47:52.660
Anyway, that's a Kinsey tidbit for you.

1178
00:47:52.660 --> 00:47:58.560
So the end of this episode, Pam has been crying and Jim wants to cheer her up.

